{# What happened in a client space while nobody was looking.

   A single email for the space, not one per event: a client who approves three
   cards and then writes a message did one thing worth interrupting someone
   for, and that is "something happened at this client's".

   The link leads to the space, not to one of the events: that is where people
   answer, and it is also what marks the rest as read. #}
<p>{{ 'studio.email.space_activity.body'|trans({'{space}': space.name}) }}</p>

<ul>
    {% for line in lines %}
        <li>{{ line }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>

<p><a href="{{ url }}">{{ 'studio.email.space_activity.cta'|trans }}</a></p>

<p>{{ 'studio.email.space_activity.quiet'|trans }}</p>
